      "hizbQuarter": 102,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1744,
      "text": "Thus We have sent it down as a commandment in Arabic. If you were to follow their[29] desires after the knowledge that has come to you, you would have no supporter or protector against Allah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 13,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرَّعۡدِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Ra'd",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Thunder",
        "numberOfAyahs": 43,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 13,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 254,
      "ruku": 209,
      "hizbQuarter": 102,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1745,
      "text": "We have sent messengers before you and gave them wives and offspring[30]. It was not for any messenger to bring a sign except with Allah’s permission. Every matter has a destined time.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 13,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرَّعۡدِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Ra'd",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Thunder",
        "numberOfAyahs": 43,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 13,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 254,
      "ruku": 210,
      "hizbQuarter": 102,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1746,
      "text": "Allah eliminates what He wills or affirms it[31], and with Him is the Master Book[32].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 13,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرَّعۡدِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Ra'd",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Thunder",
        "numberOfAyahs": 43,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 13,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 254,
      "ruku": 210,
      "hizbQuarter": 102,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1747,
      "text": "Whether We show you [O Prophet] part of what We warn them or cause you to die [before that], your duty is only to convey the message, and the reckoning is for Us.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 13,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرَّعۡدِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Ra'd",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Thunder",
        "numberOfAyahs": 43,
